Pipeline Optimizations

Add --asm-only / --no-assemble mode in nobasic_compiler.py.
Skip assembler invocation during iteration or test loops.
Compile-time gain: typically ~30-70% faster edit-compile cycles for codegen-only work.

Add incremental compile cache keyed by source hash + flags.
Cache token stream/AST/semantic artifacts when unchanged.
Compile-time gain: ~40-80% on repeated runs in local iteration.

Add pass-level timing and counters in verbose mode.
Report instruction counts pre/post each pass and spill/load-store counts.
Not direct speedup, but improves optimization ROI quickly.

**Additions**
Peek/poke instructions for memory ops.